## Attribution note

**Original work.** The tutorial text, diagrams, C# samples, Kubernetes values,
runbooks, cheat sheets, incident write-ups and the case study in this folder are
original and written for this repository. They are covered by the MIT license
above — copy, adapt and reuse them freely.

**Not original.** Product behaviour, default values, quota numbers, tier limits
and API surfaces are summaries of vendor documentation. Those belong to their
owners:

| Source | Owner | Used for |
|---|---|---|
| Apache Kafka documentation | Apache Software Foundation (Apache 2.0) | Broker config names, protocol semantics |
| Azure Service Bus documentation | Microsoft | Tier limits, quotas, SDK surface |
| RabbitMQ documentation | Broadcom / VMware (Mozilla Public License 2.0) | Exchange types, plugin behaviour |
| Confluent documentation | Confluent Inc. | Schema Registry, tiered storage notes |

Vendor limits and prices move. Every number in this repo is marked with the date
it was checked. Verify against the live docs before you put money or an SLA
behind it. Links are in the References section of
[`docs/tutorial.md`](docs/tutorial.md#25-references-and-further-reading).
